Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.96,0:00:04.56,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A fantastic match from Alexandra Eala.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N伊埃拉这一场打得太精彩！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.56,0:00:06.74,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Back to winning ways is the Filipina,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N菲律宾球员重返胜利轨道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.74,0:00:10.44,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Having begun this match on a two-match losing skid.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她此前遭遇了两连败
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.55,0:00:13.33,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}首盘{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 比分还没拉开
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.33,0:00:15.17,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}伊埃拉随后连赢{\fs78}7{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.17,0:00:18.32,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}跨过盘末 把第二盘带到{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.32,0:00:21.30,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}她在宁波 重返胜利轨道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.15,0:00:24.32,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}19{\fs68}日晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:26.14,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}宁波{\fs78}500{\fs68}赛首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.14,0:00:27.93,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}伊埃拉对阵帕里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.93,0:00:29.78,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}武汉首轮遭逆转后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.78,0:00:32.47,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}她来到宁波 重新出发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:43.16,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, that's so good from Diane Parry!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N帕里打得太漂亮了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.16,0:00:46.04,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}On the full stretch, the full run, showing her strength.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N全速奔跑 奋力伸展 展现实力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.30,0:00:48.66,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A lot of matches have been played, a lot of highs and lows.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛打了不少 也历经起伏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.94,0:01:05.06,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, this is an opportunity here for Alexandra Eala.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N伊埃拉迎来了机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:09.38,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Struggling for confidence and form.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N仍苦于找回信心和状态
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.43,0:01:10.61,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}首盘{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.61,0:01:13.66,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}伊埃拉的接发站位已经压向底线
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.66,0:01:16.95,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}持续施压之下 帕里连续正拍失误
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.95,0:01:19.16,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}再次破掉对手的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.16,0:01:21.07,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}她拿回了主动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.12,0:01:30.34,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, it's a stupendous point! Well done to Eala.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这分精彩！伊埃拉打得好！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.64,0:01:45.58,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Such a good point from Eala,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N伊埃拉这分打得真好！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.58,0:01:49.34,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And it all started with a fantastic return, didn't it?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N始于那记精彩接发 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.62,0:01:59.62,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, there's nothing she could do about that.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一球 她无能为力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.72,0:02:02.34,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That is just sumptuous from Diane Parry.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N帕里这一拍太精妙了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:04.86,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Looking like she's going to attack.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N看样子她准备进攻了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.26,0:02:12.82,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The pressure paying off.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N持续施压见效了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.68,0:02:15.20,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Parry missing a couple of forehands.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N帕里几次正拍失误
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.48,0:02:16.50,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Eala on the prowl again.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N伊埃拉又在寻找机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.64,0:02:18.46,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Just look at her return position.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N看她的接发站位
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.42,0:02:22.38,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Parry has noticed it. There's a little double look there.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N帕里察觉到了 又多看一眼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.42,0:02:25.84,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's got to concentrate on what she can control.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N专注于自己能掌控的事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.98,0:02:42.86,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Parry thought about coming forward, and really, with her volley…{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N帕里想上网 以她的截击
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.30,0:02:54.44,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The first serve percentage has been similar to that of the Filipina,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一发成功率与菲律宾球员接近
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.76,0:02:56.80,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But it's only about two-thirds.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但也只有约三分之二
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.70,0:03:02.06,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Both have won three second-serve points thus far.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N目前两人二发都赢了三分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.72,0:03:13.98,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That is really unfortunate. First double fault.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N真遗憾 第一次双误
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.03,0:03:16.60,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 伊埃拉拿下首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:18.57,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}进入第二盘 她敢上网
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.57,0:03:21.06,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}也用正拍斜线耐心相持
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.06,0:03:24.19,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}跨盘连赢{\fs78}7{\fs68}局 比分来到{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.19,0:03:26.96,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}可是 领先还不是终点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.62,0:03:31.52,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}…Diana Shnaider, on grass at last year's Wimbledon.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N去年温网草地赛的施耐德
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:39.68,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's beautifully done. This time it's Eala coming forward.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N真漂亮！这次伊埃拉上网
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.10,0:03:50.66,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.78,0:03:53.66,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Quite the opposite after that stunner.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N那记好球后 局面正好相反
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.24,0:04:15.88,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, yes! It's another one for the highlight reel from Diane Parry.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N好球！帕里又添集锦佳作
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.84,0:04:35.96,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, it's good patient play from Eala,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N伊埃拉打得很耐心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.70,0:04:38.74,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Content to go cross-court with the forehand.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N耐心用正拍打斜线
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.79,0:04:39.98,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}第二盘{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.98,0:04:42.66,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}自己的发球局 {\fs78}40{\fs68}比{\fs78}15{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.66,0:04:44.21,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}伊埃拉却连丢四分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.21,0:04:46.09,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}被帕里追回一局
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.09,0:04:50.09,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}她马上回破 {\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} 重新拿稳主动
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.26,0:05:02.28,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, that's clever!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一拍真聪明！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.70,0:05:05.58,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Puts the racket down to help balance, change direction.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N放低球拍稳住平衡 再变向
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.84,0:05:18.44,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A fantastic match from Alexandra Eala.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N伊埃拉这一场打得太精彩！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.44,0:05:20.62,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Back to winning ways is the Filipina,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N菲律宾球员重返胜利轨道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.62,0:05:24.32,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Having begun this match on a two-match losing skid.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她此前遭遇了两连败
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.56,0:05:28.52,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Diane Parry's losing run moves to five straight, though.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不过 帕里已遭遇五连败
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.52,0:05:31.04,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Didn't see the best from the Frenchwoman today,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N今天法国球员未达最佳水平
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.04,0:05:32.58,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But it was exceptional, wasn't it,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但这表现 实在太出色了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.58,0:05:37.20,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}From the twenty-one-year-old superstar of the WTA Tour.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N来自这位{\fs78}21{\fs68}岁的{\fs78}WTA{\fs68}巨星
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.50,0:05:41.36,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Gets the better of Diane Parry in their first meeting{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首次交锋 她击败帕里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.36,0:05:43.48,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Here in China.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就在中国的赛场上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.82,0:05:45.94,TL,,0,0,540,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She is a victor,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她成为了胜者
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.94,0:05:48.36,TL,,0,0,540,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Six-three and six-one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N六比三 六比一
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.41,0:05:50.39,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.39,0:05:52.04,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}制胜分{\fs78}12{\fs68}比{\fs78}11{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.04,0:05:54.54,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}非受迫失误{\fs78}9{\fs68}比{\fs78}25{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.54,0:05:56.70,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}伊埃拉在对手{\fs78}8{\fs68}个发球局里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.70,0:05:58.07,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}拿走{\fs78}6{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.07,0:06:01.15,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}接下来的挑战 还在继续
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.01,0:06:05.04,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}从武汉的遗憾 到宁波的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.04,0:06:06.52,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}伊埃拉在这一站
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.52,0:06:08.35,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}已经迈出第一步
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.35,0:06:11.66,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}下一轮 你看好她继续向前吗？
